/// dimCustomer: An SCD Type 2 customer dimension containing one row per customer per historical version. Stores customer identity (CustomerID, CustomerName), segmentation (CustomerSegmentName), geographic hierarchy (Country → Region → State → City → PostalCode), and change-tracking columns (IsCurrent, ValidFrom, ValidTo). Used as the primary customer dimension across fact tables to enable customer-level filtering, geographic analysis, and point-in-time reporting.
